<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Santa Cruz Cty, Calif., COPs deal.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Santa Cruz Cty, Calif., COPs deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance by direct purchase Santa Cruz County, Calif.'s $25 million certificates of participation issue, which the firm said is selling by competitive bids Wednesday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
